; Law 16(d), through the runner it exists for: an inline (ppx) partition
; with a mutant armed must report an [%expect] mismatch as a plain
; failure and write no .corrected. runner_main.exe mirrors the
; inline_tests backend's generated runner; ../test_mutate_loop.exe spawns
; it with the protocol argv, once unarmed and once armed, and checks the
; sandbox for correction files afterwards.

(executable
 (name runner_main)
 (modules runner_main inline_armed)
 (libraries windtrap ppx_windtrap.runtime mutate_loop_subject)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_windtrap)))
